sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Mentor
  participant UI as React app
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor S as Student
  M->>UI: Click Accept on request
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/mentoring-requests/{id}/accept (E27)
  API->>API: Verify JWT, role = mentor, owns request
  API->>DB: BEGIN
  API->>DB: SELECT request FOR UPDATE
  alt request not pending
    API-->>UI: 409 INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION
  else mentor at capacity
    API-->>UI: 409 MENTOR_AT_CAPACITY
  else valid
    API->>DB: UPDATE request SET status = accepted
    API->>DB: INSERT mentorship (active)
    API->>DB: INSERT notification for student
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 200 request and mentorship
    UI-->>M: Toast, redirect to My mentees
    S-->>UI: Bell shows unread (poll E42)
  end
